{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34129","headline":"杂体诗 胥口即事六言二首 一 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 胥口即事六言二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"波光杳杳不极，霁景澹澹初斜。\n黑蛱蝶粘莲蘂，红蜻蜓褭菱花。\n鸳鸯一处两处，舴艋三家五家。\n会把酒船偎荻，共君作个生涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}